Sparkz uses Reown AppKit (@reown/appkit and related packages) and WalletConnect
(@walletconnect/* packages) to connect wallets. They are NOT under Apache-2.0 or
any open-source licence. They are under the Reown Community License Agreement and
the WalletConnect Community License Agreement, whose texts are in the licenses/
